      "text": [
        "2291 - وَ رُوِيَ : أَنَّهُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ حَجَّ عِشْرِينَ حَجَّةً مُسْتَسِرّاً وَ فِي كُلِّهَا يَمُرُّ بِالْمَأْزِمَيْنِ فَيَنْزِلُ وَ يَبُولُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2291 - It has been narrated:\nThe Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him and his family) performed twenty Hajj pilgrimages secretly. In each of them, he would pass through the two mountain passes (Al-Ma'ziman), dismount, and relieve himself."
        ]
      }
